{
 "commit": "8a99d02b3a2111aacd9ed81c3e415af47f73505e",
 "readme": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "c": [
    "The Floorspec extension registry (FLR-ADR-007, Core chapter 12, from Core 0.2). Each extension has a directory named after it, holding the ",
    {
     "t": "strong",
     "c": [
      "registry entry"
     ]
    },
    " of its current version:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "lang": "text",
   "v": "registry/<NAME>/extension.json     the registry entry\nregistry/<NAME>/spec.md            its specification, tagged in its own ID space ({#FS-ELEC-3.1.1 MUST})\nregistry/<NAME>/<short>.schema.json   its JSON Schema, whose $id is the entry's `schema` URL"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "c": [
    "A Proposal holds ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "proposal.md"
    },
    ", its rationale, instead; the specification, the schema and the suite — ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "conformance/ext/<NAME>/<version>/"
    },
    " (",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "conformance/README.md"
    },
    ") — are required from Draft on, and ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "evidence/"
    },
    " from Release Candidate on (Lifecycle, below). The spec site publishes a schema at the URL its ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "$id"
    },
    " gives: ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "https://d3cloud.io/floorspec/schema/ext/<NAME>/<version>/<short>.schema.json"
    },
    "."
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "c": [
    "An entry matches ",
    {
     "t": "a",
     "href": "/floorspec/schema/registry/0.1/extension.schema.json",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "code",
       "v": "schema/registry/0.1/extension.schema.json"
      }
     ]
    },
    ", published at ",
    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "https://d3cloud.io/floorspec/schema/registry/0.1/extension.schema.json"
    },
    ". Earlier versions' entries stay recoverable from this repository's history and at their published URLs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "lang": "json",
   "v": "{\n  \"name\": \"EXT_lighting\",\n  \"version\": \"1.2.0\",\n  \"status\": \"draft\",\n  \"schema\": \"https://d3cloud.io/floorspec/schema/ext/EXT_lighting/1.2.0/lighting.schema.json\",\n  \"title\": \"Lighting\",\n  \"requires\": { \"FS_electrical\": \"^0.3.0\" },\n  \"kinds\": { \"fixtures\": { \"title\": \"Light fixture\", \"fallback\": { \"symbol\": true } } },\n  \"terms\": { \"roomFunctions\": [] },\n  \"implementations\": []\n}"
  },
  {
