    {
     "t": "code",
     "v": "extensions.<NAME>"
    },
    " of the derived values. Records that are not elements — circuits, stacks, gas sources — share the document's one space of IDs, so diagnostics can name them. Data an extension records on core elements (FS_structural's, on walls, openings, slabs, rooms and roofs) is each element's own ",
    {
